      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] the two sides [stipulat]ed and consented between themselves, and they took upon themselves the stipulations of the court from beginning to\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[end.... And we performed a qinyan ... with a suitable implement] for all that is written and specified above. Valid, strong, firm, confirmed and trustworthy\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[is this marriage contract... whether in the courts of the gentile]s or in the laws of our masters the sages. In good order. \"Of Mordecai\" is written on an erasure and is validated.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... b.] Zadok ha-Kohen (may his) e(nd be) g(ood). Elijah b. David (who) r(ests in) E(den). Isaac b. R. Joseph (whose) s(oul is at) r(est).\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] (may his) m(emory) be (a blessing). Yeshu\u02bfahu b. Ezekiel (whose) s(oul is at) r(est).</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
